Vint Cerf is a gunslinger in the employ of the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]]. He wears a leather rig under a loud shirt and shorts, the leather showing at the seams, and carries a long rifle whose silencer works by illusion, a bandolier of pistols, and a second bandolier of cigarettes, cigars and other smoking things. He has a thick mustache and the manner of a man who has been to a war.

He trusts almost no one and says so out loud, and he is quick with a gun and quicker with a word.
